{
	"name": "Warrior of Devotion",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/magic/fire/dagger-rune-enchant-flame-strong-blue.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>You have continued your training and have learned to create a special weapon that draws upon your heraldic powers for additional effects. You gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li><p>Your Strength, Wisdom, or Charisma score increases by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p></li><li><p>Choose one of the following creature types: dragons, monstrosities, or constructs. Your @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.01szspr1nunp0lql]{Divine Sense} can also pick up the selected creature type, regardless of which option you have active.</p></li><li><p>You gain proficiency with smith’s tools.</p></li><li><p>Choose one of the following exotic weapons: torch mace, rampart shield, or battle censer. You gain proficiency with the selected weapon.</p></li></ul>",
